        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/k/e68b1a/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-10T00:06:38.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>i reading FAQ, and i have some confuse.</p>\n<p>that is</p>\n<p><span>If an effect&nbsp;</span><em>(e.g., A Year of Perfect Stillness)</em><span>&nbsp;skips \"all actions\", what is affected?</span></p>\n<div>\n\tAny time the Invaders would Ravage, Build or Explore that turn, any number of times.</div>\n<div>\n\tThis includes any normal actions that come from the Invader cards, and also any extra actions that come from effects like the power Manifestation of Power and Glory or the event New Cash Crops Take Hold.&nbsp;<em>(See the B&amp;C rulebook, p. 15, for the distinction between \"normal\" and \"extra\" actions.)</em>\n</div>\n<div>\n\t&nbsp;</div>\n<p>&nbsp;Manifestation of Power and Glory is</p>\n<p>'<span>1 Fear. Each Dahan deals damage equal to the number of your Presence in target land.'</span></p>\n<p>and&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5kcdu\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">A Year of Perfect Stillnes</a>s&nbsp;is</strong></p>\n<p><span>'Invaders skipp all Actions in target land this turn.'</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>if&nbsp; Manifestation of Power and Glory and a year of perfect stillness used same land, FAQ is read as if MOPAG is not affected that land.</p>\n<div>\n\t&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n\t&nbsp;</div>\n<div>\n\t<span>i think,&nbsp;</span>&nbsp;Manifestation of Power and Glory&nbsp; effect is not 'invader action'.</div>\n<div>\n\tso, i feel MOPAG is no need to Mentioned to 'this FAQ'</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>help me.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:51:52.211Z",
