      {
        "id": 222026,
        "name": "dpt",
        "username": "dpt",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/dpt/{size}/1922_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-09-10T00:39:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just for reference, here's a link to the <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5katl\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">FAQ entry in question</a>.</p>\n<p>It mentions a different power, Manifest Incarnation, from Branch &amp; Claw (not Manifestation of Power and Glory).&nbsp; The text of Manifest Incarnation is</p>\n<blockquote>\n\t<p>6 Fear. +1 Fear for each Town / City and for each of your Presence in target land. Remove 1 City, 1 Town and 1 Explorer. Then Invaders in target land Ravage.</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>That effect is relevant to the FAQ entry.</p>\n<p>EDIT: Brian got to it before I did, and also fixed the FAQ entry. Thanks for noticing this!</p>",
