        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "<p>Just for reference, here's a link to the <a href=\"https://querki.net/u/darker/spirit-island-faq/#!.9v5katl\">FAQ entry in question</a>.</p>\r\n<p>It mentions a different power, Manifest Incarnation, from Branch &amp; Claw (not Manifestation of Power and Glory).&nbsp; The text of Manifest Incarnation is</p>\r\n<blockquote>\r\n\t<p>6 Fear. +1 Fear for each Town / City and for each of your Presence in target land. Remove 1 City, 1 Town and 1 Explorer. Then Invaders in target land Ravage.</p>\r\n</blockquote>\r\n<p>That effect is relevant to the FAQ entry.</p>\r\n<p>EDIT: Brian got to it before I did, and also fixed the FAQ entry. Thanks for noticing this!</p>",
